<title>MEXICO: Grupo Video nine-month net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Grupo Video nine-month net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Oper Income	43.50 million		48.56 million</p>
<p>	Net profit	 36.49 million	loss  33.24 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 666.71 million	     658.91 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Video Visa SA de CV.</p>
<p>	  Both operating income figures are profits.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom, (525) 728-9507</p>
